<title>USA: CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 396 contracts.</title>
<headline>CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 396 contracts.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chicago Board of Trade said its Project A overnight agricultural contracts volume totaled 396 contracts versus 745 lots traded overnight Wednesday.</p>
<p>It said 94 wheat, 106 corn, 141 soybean, 43 soymeal, one oat and 11 rough rice contracts traded.</p>
<p>In overnight trade, wheat was 1/2 cent lower, corn was 1/4 to 1/2 cent lower and soybeans were 1/4 to 1-1/2 cents lower.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8720</p>
